{"title":"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A store normally sells windows at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> each. This week the store is offering one free window for each purchase of four. Dave needs seven windows and Doug needs eight windows. How many dollars will they save if they purchase the windows together rather than separately?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd3ce4f88a9742402d5a1c78d31330dd8cd99e63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 100\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 200\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 300\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 400\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"446\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The store's offer means that every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th window is free, so Dave would get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c041aa4e44a78078451569e16c026ae20ceabe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{7}{5}\\right\\rfloor=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"66\" height=\"43\" /> free window and Doug would also get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/96066bbd014f0f1c524dc5d88b7d75d8d73e95c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{8}{5}\\right\\rfloor=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"66\" height=\"43\" /> free window. \n</p><p>This is a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/b/39b50ce24de2036ae4e7cab78aa48b503ab588e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> free windows. \n</p><p>Together, by contrast, they would get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a85487ceece443df89538301df1871fc1b7daf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{8+7}{5}\\right\\rfloor = \\left\\lfloor\\frac{15}{5}\\right\\rfloor=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"165\" height=\"43\" /> free windows.\n</p><p>Hence they get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/1/b419b91958d111b91db52e72a0e8d750e2b23174.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> additional window if they purchase the windows together, so the amount (in dollars) that they save is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdfaf6bfba7e642ec3859d28040b17e284440166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\cdot100= \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"150\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ECBXQ1cE2SI\">https://youtu.be/ECBXQ1cE2SI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tsai14EkXgQ\">https://youtu.be/tsai14EkXgQ</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" s